nc_oc=Adq2RyY4CnXBA7Vz-9nuQJ3_QLa8cfJ4XE-S7s5kGsO_E30smUdsKhpAyfhIIC3XhDs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLVvjhs4QCYQAMWNwHxgm9TBmPOc4A448EskKUTLWKwog&oe=6A9AE3C1"}, "display_name": "ZOMBONK", "keywords": ["zombie", "gun", "shooting", "multiplayer", "monke"], "long_description": "# Bonker wake up. World gone. Whatever.\n\nZombies and monsters everywhere. Bonker still vibing. \ud83d\ude0e\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nExplore maps, crack open boxes, hunt for gear, survive long enough to flex it.\n\nLoot stuff \u2192 Sell stuff \u2192 Get Bonk$ \u2192 Buy drip. \n\n# Multiple maps to choose from:\n- \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f Bonktopia City - open, quiet, and NOT SAFE\n- \ud83e\udddf Zombie Survival - relentless waves, COD zombies vibes\n- \ud83c\udfeb School - three levels. too many footsteps.\n- \ud83d\udef0\ufe0f Space - out it the orbit, something broke into the station\n- \ud83d\udca3 War - they started it, you end it\n- \ud83d\udc1bNest - what lies underground will shock you\n- \ud83c\udffaTemple - explore the secrets of the civilizations before bonkers\n- \ud83c\udfaa Bonkland - horror carnival with dark rooms, laser pathways, & targets everywhere.\n- \ud83c\udd99 Skybonk - an Only Up inspired parkour map, with zombies of course\n\nPro Tip: Bonk with friends for more loot and more BONK$. \n\nPlay in private servers or chill in the Social Hub safe zone to hang with fellow Bonkers.\n\n**\ud83e\udd1d Come hang in discord, and meet our bonker community \ud83d\udc49 discord.gg/zbvr**\n", "short_description": "Survive the zombie apocalypse, loot for guns and items!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/terms-of-service", "publisher_name": "Sinn Studio Inc.", "support_website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/contact", "website_url": "https://www.sinnstudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABL